  "description": "NetToolsKit.AspNetCore.Swagger streamlines Swagger (Swashbuckle) setup to produce clean, useful API documentation.\n\n\t\t\tFeatures:\n\t\t\t• Turn‑key SwaggerGen and UI configuration.\n\t\t\t• Custom filters to enrich operations, schemas, and security.\n\t\t\t• API key header scheme and versioning support.\n\n\t\t\tIdeal for APIs that need predictable, polished Swagger output with minimal boilerplate.",
